<title>USA: Compaq creates separate China division.</title>
<headline>Compaq creates separate China division.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compaq Computer Corp said Monday it had separated China, Hong Kong and Taiwan into a distinct geographic division within company operations.</p>
<p>Compaq said it had named Dr. Philip Yu as president of the new division, in charge of overseeing sales, marketing, service and manufacturing operations.  </p>
<p>Yu most recently was chairman and chief executive of Nortel (China) Ltd, a unit of Northern Telecom Ltd.</p>
<p>Compaq's geographic divisions now include North America, Japan, Asia Pacific, Latin America, Europe, Middle East and Africa, and &quot;Greater China.&quot;</p>
</text>
